        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.61,
            0.124,
            0.812,
            0.143
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Working with Sequences"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.54,
            0.154,
            0.813,
            0.171
          ],
          "content": "• Sequences are potentially **unbounded**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.557,
            0.172,
            0.834,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": "§ Number of elements inside them is not fixed"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.19,
            0.882,
            0.207
          ],
          "content": "§ Functions must handle sequences of different lengths"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.557,
            0.208,
            0.857,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": "§ **Example**: sum([1,2,3]) vs. sum([4,5,6,7,8,9,10])"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.539,
            0.227,
            0.843,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": "• Cannot process with **fixed** number of lines"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.557,
            0.246,
            0.862,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "§ Each line of code can handle at most one element"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.556,
            0.263,
            0.824,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": "§ What if # of elements > # of lines of code?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.539,
            0.283,
            0.787,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": "• We need a new **control structure**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.621,
            0.406,
            0.801,
            0.424
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Executing a For-Loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.72,
            0.43,
            0.824,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": "• **iterable:** seqn"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.721,
            0.447,
            0.838,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": "• **loop variable**: x"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.721,
            0.464,
            0.825,
            0.48
          ],
          "content": "• **body**: print(x)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.563,
            0.686,
            0.86,
            0.705
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Example: String-Based Accumulator"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.54,
            0.716,
            0.641,
            0.732
          ],
          "content": "def despace(s):"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.555,
            0.731,
            0.824,
            0.748
          ],
          "content": "\"\"\"Returns: s but with its spaces removed"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.555,
            0.746,
            0.741,
            0.763
          ],
          "content": "Precondition: s is a string\"\"\""
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.555,
            0.765,
            0.624,
            0.781
          ],
          "content": "result = ''"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.556,
            0.785,
            0.626,
            0.8
          ],
          "content": "for x in s:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.572,
            0.802,
            0.631,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": "if x != '':"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.588,
            0.821,
            0.704,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "<u>result = result+x</u>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.738,
            0.817,
            0.777,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": "**Body**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.556,
            0.84,
            0.647,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "return result"
        },
